WEBVTT

00:03.077 --> 00:04.408
Rumina...

00:23.731 --> 00:25.426
Sarasa is not well...

00:25.500 --> 00:28.367
...all because of that
surface dweller?

00:31.072 --> 00:32.972
Could there be any other reason?

01:09.377 --> 01:10.435
What's the matter?

01:15.216 --> 01:16.911
You've gotten thin, Sarasa.

01:18.853 --> 01:21.253
Is there something you want?

01:21.923 --> 01:23.550
Clothes or food...

01:23.958 --> 01:26.950
I can get you anything you want.

01:28.396 --> 01:29.192
Outside...

01:29.530 --> 01:30.292
What?!

01:30.765 --> 01:32.027
I want to go outside.

01:32.500 --> 01:33.398
No!

01:33.968 --> 01:36.766
You could be attacked
by the resistance!

01:36.838 --> 01:37.964
Remember?

01:39.574 --> 01:40.836
It's dangerous out there.

01:41.409 --> 01:44.845
As long as you are in the care of the
Company, no one can hurt you.

01:47.448 --> 01:49.848
Rumina Asagi, huh?

01:50.451 --> 01:52.043
You want to see him?

01:53.855 --> 01:58.554
I wonder what he would think
if he saw you now?

01:58.893 --> 01:59.552
What?!

02:15.710 --> 02:18.372
Team Rayon, you're up next!

02:22.650 --> 02:23.582
All right!

02:23.885 --> 02:24.783
Let's go!

02:26.821 --> 02:27.788
This one?

02:28.356 --> 02:29.050
Yes.

02:29.557 --> 02:31.684
I want the same one
that I had before.

02:32.727 --> 02:34.024
Very well.

03:10.331 --> 03:15.701
HEY YOU!
Shiraketa kao de nageite iru dake ja

03:16.470 --> 03:21.339
tabun nani mo hajimara nai
nige wa shinaide

03:21.876 --> 03:28.076
hashiri dashite iru mirai ga
aruno nara

03:28.149 --> 03:34.213
fukaku ochi konderu
hima wa nai

03:34.288 --> 03:40.557
hito wa sou daremo ga
toki to shite mayoi

03:40.628 --> 03:46.498
atae rareta hibi wo
tada ikite iru kedo

03:46.567 --> 03:52.699
ushinatte wa nara nai mono

03:52.773 --> 03:58.803
kakaete mamotte kizu tsuite

03:58.879 --> 04:05.045
sore demo mata aruki daseru

04:05.119 --> 04:11.854
chikara wo shinji teru yo

04:16.931 --> 04:21.834
Reason - Treacherous Flame

04:24.705 --> 04:27.765
We now present to you
the last qualifying round of the...

04:27.842 --> 04:29.901
...Underground Fighting
Tournament!

04:30.378 --> 04:34.144
To which team will the goddess
of victory grant her favor?

04:34.482 --> 04:38.441
First, we have a team which
has performed outstandingly.

04:38.819 --> 04:42.380
The stars of the moment,
Team Rayon!

04:44.925 --> 04:46.483
And they are up against...

04:47.094 --> 04:49.028
Team Flame!

04:49.864 --> 04:52.890
This is an amazing team
that's shrouded in mystery!

04:53.000 --> 04:55.332
And they too have won
every match so far!

04:55.403 --> 04:56.995
A truly formidable force!

05:01.342 --> 05:03.071
Why are they dressed like that?

05:03.310 --> 05:04.641
Are you scared of them?

05:04.912 --> 05:05.571
Who is?!

05:05.813 --> 05:08.782
I can sense that those guys
are taking this very seriously.

05:09.050 --> 05:11.450
This is the last qualifying round,
after all.

05:15.322 --> 05:16.311
That man...

05:18.259 --> 05:18.850
Huh?

05:19.326 --> 05:20.418
Is something the matter?

05:21.962 --> 05:23.827
Uh, nothing.

05:27.301 --> 05:29.633
All right! The first match is...

05:29.703 --> 05:31.170
Right. I'm going.

05:31.338 --> 05:32.532
Wait, Korin.

05:34.675 --> 05:35.903
I'll go.

05:37.578 --> 05:38.704
What?

05:38.779 --> 05:39.871
What's up with you?

05:41.582 --> 05:44.949
I want to fight that man.

05:47.721 --> 05:48.813
Desperately.

05:50.024 --> 05:50.991
Fine.

05:51.325 --> 05:52.189
But, why?

05:52.593 --> 05:53.787
I'll tell you later.

05:57.498 --> 05:58.829
What?!

05:59.133 --> 05:59.963
Why?

06:00.768 --> 06:02.736
You always come with me!

06:03.671 --> 06:05.571
I have an urgent assignment.

06:05.906 --> 06:07.567
But you don't have to worry.

06:07.875 --> 06:11.675
You will have capable guards.
Don't worry about security.

06:11.946 --> 06:13.413
I don't care about security.

06:13.914 --> 06:16.144
I just want to be with you.

06:16.217 --> 06:16.911
Here.

06:17.685 --> 06:19.312
I baked some cookies.

06:20.454 --> 06:23.150
I will join you as soon as I'm done.

06:23.424 --> 06:26.018
We can have them together.

06:26.961 --> 06:27.985
Do you promise?

06:28.829 --> 06:30.854
Yes. I promise.

06:38.772 --> 06:39.898
A decoy assignment?!

06:43.477 --> 06:46.105
We had to get you out of the way...

06:46.180 --> 06:48.740
...so that we could kidnap
the Maiden of Life.

06:50.451 --> 06:51.315
Ruri!

06:54.388 --> 06:58.950
Very few people know
her daily schedule.

06:59.693 --> 07:00.921
Could there have been a mole?

07:02.163 --> 07:02.959
From where?

07:03.397 --> 07:04.227
And who?!

07:11.739 --> 07:13.138
We're surrounded.

07:13.340 --> 07:15.137
The routes are blocked!

07:15.743 --> 07:16.505
Damn!

07:16.844 --> 07:18.937
We can't move until
reinforcements arrive.

07:20.281 --> 07:22.476
Do not be alarmed, Maiden.

07:22.550 --> 07:25.383
We power users will stay close
by your side.

07:27.087 --> 07:31.080
No need to fear the resistance,
they have no power users.

07:33.694 --> 07:35.218
My arm! My arm!

07:36.497 --> 07:37.486
The flames! The flames!

07:48.576 --> 07:53.570
There actually
is a power user...

07:53.647 --> 07:55.512
...among the resistance.

08:09.563 --> 08:13.897
So this is the evil Maiden who is
plotting to resurrect the Dragons?

08:14.501 --> 08:16.901
If you hadn't appeared...

08:16.971 --> 08:19.963
...the Company wouldn't have
started to talk about the Dragons...

08:20.040 --> 08:21.769
...or revenge against
the surface dwellers.

08:22.076 --> 08:25.512
I doubt a little princess off
to a picnic with some cookies...

08:25.579 --> 08:29.345
...could understand the pain that
the Company has brought on us.

08:37.925 --> 08:40.860
I will join you as soon
as I'm done with my assignment.

08:40.928 --> 08:43.158
We can have them together.

08:44.865 --> 08:48.357
We'll give you a small taste
of the pain and suffering...

08:48.435 --> 08:50.266
...that we had to endure.

09:00.080 --> 09:03.948
We can't let our guard down
even with a little girl like this.

09:04.585 --> 09:08.783
But those Company guys
sure fell for our plan.

09:09.623 --> 09:13.252
Thanks to the information
you were able to get for us...

09:13.327 --> 09:15.056
...former Master Warrior.

09:26.040 --> 09:28.531
Look, you! Just settle down!

09:30.210 --> 09:31.609
Be careful with her.

09:32.446 --> 09:34.277
She's our precious bait.

09:37.618 --> 09:38.846
I won't give up.

09:41.055 --> 09:43.319
I know Chelsea will come.

09:59.273 --> 10:04.609
From long ago, we always seem
to meet in the oddest places.

10:08.916 --> 10:09.883
Rensho!

10:26.734 --> 10:29.032
I intend to see the Company
go up in flames.

10:33.073 --> 10:35.439
I knew there was a traitor.

10:36.009 --> 10:39.501
I want you to tell me
where Ruri is.

10:40.581 --> 10:45.109
After seeing all this, you still
think that the Maiden is alive?

10:45.419 --> 10:46.147
Of course.

10:47.921 --> 10:50.549
Well, she's alive.

10:51.392 --> 10:54.691
But that was a few minutes ago...

10:58.599 --> 10:59.224
Too slow!

11:00.667 --> 11:02.066
Fire Dragon!

11:07.975 --> 11:09.670
The Company comprises of
a bunch of imbeciles.

11:10.411 --> 11:12.936
If they had recognized my ability...

11:13.013 --> 11:15.504
...none of this would've happened.

11:17.651 --> 11:19.482
Have you matured a bit?

11:20.120 --> 11:21.587
Thanks to you.

11:22.756 --> 11:26.624
So, now you're a full-fledged
member of the resistance?

11:29.062 --> 11:30.495
You could say that.

11:32.800 --> 11:34.392
Fire Dragon!

11:35.135 --> 11:37.763
Who's that guy she's up against?

11:37.838 --> 11:40.306
Oh? Are we getting jealous?

11:40.374 --> 11:42.604
Hey!
That's not what I meant, stupid!

11:42.676 --> 11:44.166
Fire Dragon...

11:44.378 --> 11:46.437
I've heard of that before.

11:51.084 --> 11:53.518
Seki can think he's powerful
all he wants...

11:53.587 --> 11:56.852
...but my power outweighs his any day.

12:04.164 --> 12:08.567
How dare you use Ruri as a pawn
in your petty games!

12:08.635 --> 12:09.499
No way!

12:11.605 --> 12:13.038
Geo Impact!

12:19.279 --> 12:20.371
Kill me.

12:21.648 --> 12:24.139
Death is the punishment for traitors.

12:24.351 --> 12:27.184
Aren't those the Company rules?

12:27.454 --> 12:29.319
I want to know where Ruri is.

12:30.057 --> 12:34.426
Do you really think that
the Maiden is still alive?

12:36.263 --> 12:37.821
Of course I do.

12:39.366 --> 12:40.264
I remember!

12:40.734 --> 12:42.827
He's that traitor
everyone's hunting for.

12:43.170 --> 12:45.638
The Fire Dragon is his technique!

12:46.206 --> 12:47.400
Traitor?

12:48.342 --> 12:51.641
He's that guy
who left the Company and...

12:51.712 --> 12:53.703
...sold his soul to the resistance.

12:54.114 --> 12:55.138
To the resistance?

13:00.521 --> 13:03.285
Neither fighter gives an inch!
This is a tough battle!

13:03.590 --> 13:07.219
Will it be technique or endurance
that determines the outcome?

13:16.970 --> 13:19.837
Are you feeling all right, Maiden?

13:20.741 --> 13:21.537
Yes.

13:22.709 --> 13:23.733
Is it done already?!

13:24.211 --> 13:24.768
Yes.

13:25.279 --> 13:26.473
Would you like to see?

13:26.947 --> 13:27.572
Yes!

13:35.088 --> 13:37.648
Do you think he'll remember you?

13:38.892 --> 13:42.293
These are the clothes I was wearing
the first time I met him.

13:43.330 --> 13:45.457
I feel like I shouldn't give up.

13:46.166 --> 13:48.157
I believe I'll see him again.

13:50.337 --> 13:51.497
Kill me.

13:56.209 --> 13:57.005
Kashin...

13:59.713 --> 14:01.271
Kill me.

14:03.283 --> 14:04.773
Please.

14:06.920 --> 14:09.514
Please, Kashin.

14:11.091 --> 14:13.184
So it was my fault, huh?

14:13.627 --> 14:14.389
Sis?

14:18.832 --> 14:23.735
It's because I was weak,
I had no power.

14:26.340 --> 14:28.308
I'll do it for you.

14:28.909 --> 14:31.935
I have power now.

14:32.946 --> 14:36.279
I mean, it is what you want.

14:37.851 --> 14:38.783
I heard...

14:39.653 --> 14:42.451
...that you escaped
from the Company.

14:42.522 --> 14:44.046
I didn't escape.

14:44.458 --> 14:46.119
I abandoned them.

14:46.893 --> 14:48.224
I'm not the same as you.

14:48.595 --> 14:53.123
But right now, we seem to be
in very similar positions.

14:58.405 --> 14:59.133
Well?

14:59.439 --> 15:01.669
You want to join the resistance?

15:02.209 --> 15:04.973
And destroy the Company?

15:11.418 --> 15:13.113
Oh, you're giving me the evil eye?

15:16.857 --> 15:20.588
You can act as tough as you want,
but you can't resist us.

15:21.662 --> 15:22.321
What?!

15:29.436 --> 15:30.903
I've come to get you.

15:33.640 --> 15:35.403
I promised you...

15:35.909 --> 15:39.504
...that we'd go see flowers
and have cookies together.

15:41.548 --> 15:42.742
Chelsea...

15:45.052 --> 15:45.916
Chelsea!

15:46.453 --> 15:47.385
Ruri...

15:47.988 --> 15:49.353
I believed in you.

15:50.557 --> 15:51.854
I believed in you.

15:52.959 --> 15:54.051
Damn!

15:54.127 --> 15:56.425
How could this happen?

15:56.496 --> 15:58.964
But we have to keep faith.

15:59.099 --> 16:02.933
We have to destroy the Company
and stop...

16:03.003 --> 16:04.561
...the oppression of our people!

16:05.038 --> 16:09.839
Anyone who puts the Maiden
in danger shall pay for it!

16:11.745 --> 16:13.872
Join the resistance!

16:14.314 --> 16:15.576
I refuse!

16:17.751 --> 16:18.615
Why?

16:18.985 --> 16:23.684
You left the Company because
you had doubts, right?

16:24.224 --> 16:24.883
No!

16:33.300 --> 16:37.259
I'm sorry. It was supposed to be
a lovely picnic.

16:38.238 --> 16:39.535
Poor things.

16:41.041 --> 16:42.804
We missed them at their peak.

16:44.778 --> 16:49.374
They bloomed to their fullest,
but now...

16:54.821 --> 16:55.651
Ruri...

16:56.556 --> 16:57.147
Huh?

16:57.691 --> 17:01.218
Would you like to see
a real flower garden?

17:01.862 --> 17:04.160
A real flower garden where...

17:04.231 --> 17:08.827
...the flowers bloom under a real
blue sky and the rays of a real sun.

17:10.303 --> 17:14.296
I just wanted to see Ruri happy.

17:15.008 --> 17:15.940
What?

17:16.343 --> 17:22.077
I don't work for the Company - I never
have and never will.

17:22.149 --> 17:23.309
I work for Ruri!

17:36.229 --> 17:37.787
I see.

17:38.865 --> 17:40.355
That's too bad.

17:42.002 --> 17:46.837
I thought we might be able to
fight alongside each other.

17:59.352 --> 18:00.250
Sarasa.

18:00.487 --> 18:01.886
Let me take you out.

18:02.222 --> 18:02.916
What?

18:03.190 --> 18:07.286
If that's your wish,
let me grant it to you.

18:08.261 --> 18:09.319
Kashin...?

18:13.500 --> 18:14.262
Come!

18:16.770 --> 18:20.399
Let me show you the most
incredible thing in the world.

18:20.473 --> 18:23.442
You won't see this on the surface
or in the Underground.

18:28.882 --> 18:29.814
That's crazy.

18:29.983 --> 18:32.952
He plans to use the device
that was planted in the slums?

18:33.220 --> 18:38.055
Why would Kashin do
something like that now?

18:42.996 --> 18:44.896
Are you behind this, Pairon?

18:45.899 --> 18:50.802
I can't be at ease until I eliminate
all those who get in the way.

18:52.572 --> 18:56.668
The first match!
The winner is Chelsea Rorec!

19:00.513 --> 19:01.639
Way to go!

19:01.848 --> 19:05.284
All right!
Let's win this and destroy Pairon...

19:05.352 --> 19:06.842
...then rescue Ruri.

19:08.021 --> 19:08.715
Right...

19:10.457 --> 19:11.389
What's the matter?

19:12.759 --> 19:13.726
Nothing...

19:15.328 --> 19:16.295
Why is it?

19:16.529 --> 19:18.622
As soon as I heard
the name "Pairon"...

19:19.099 --> 19:21.329
- I sensed a disturbance.
- All right. Time to play!

19:21.902 --> 19:25.599
What is this feeling I'm getting?

19:27.073 --> 19:29.906
I'm sure you know very well...

19:29.976 --> 19:32.843
...what would happen
if we use that device.

19:33.580 --> 19:34.478
Of course.

19:35.248 --> 19:39.651
But Kashin doesn't
seem to care whatsoever.

19:40.086 --> 19:41.678
What about the Maiden?

19:42.989 --> 19:45.549
The Maiden is my responsibility.

19:46.359 --> 19:49.055
I will guarantee her safety.

20:00.106 --> 20:02.040
And now for the second match!

20:02.108 --> 20:03.234
Begin!

20:03.543 --> 20:04.373
Huh?

20:10.917 --> 20:12.748
Hey! Look at that!

20:16.122 --> 20:18.056
Someone's appearing
on the monitor.

20:21.361 --> 20:23.090
People of the slums...

20:23.697 --> 20:25.130
- I am the ruler...
- That voice.

20:25.198 --> 20:26.597
...of the Underground...

20:26.666 --> 20:28.099
I am Kashin.

20:32.005 --> 20:32.767
Ruri!

20:43.450 --> 20:48.387
Kyoumo uso no youni

20:48.455 --> 20:54.325
migakareru machi nami wo

20:54.394 --> 21:06.829
mokuteki ga aruyou ni
aruku boku

21:07.507 --> 21:18.406
naiteruno?
Honno sasayaka na kakotachi yo

21:18.485 --> 21:30.090
miagereba
DIGITAL no SCREEN ni sora ga...

21:30.730 --> 21:39.695
kaze no uta wo
takai kaidan wo nobori

21:39.773 --> 21:43.402
kikou to shita

21:43.476 --> 21:51.645
daite
amaku kizu tsuita yume ga mou

21:51.718 --> 22:00.524
same temo ii
nakanaide

22:09.402 --> 22:11.199
Preview

22:11.271 --> 22:13.000
So you finally show yourself.

22:13.073 --> 22:14.904
You're the head honcho, huh?

22:14.974 --> 22:16.032
It's about time!

22:16.109 --> 22:17.838
I'm here to get Ruri!

22:18.111 --> 22:19.635
You've stirred up the folks here
down in the slums...

22:19.712 --> 22:21.942
...and you're trying to get them
to get rid of us!

22:22.015 --> 22:23.277
But I won't go that way.

22:23.349 --> 22:25.840
I'll blow away anyone
who gets in my way!

22:26.119 --> 22:28.917
It won't go the way you want,
Kashin!

22:29.622 --> 22:31.920
Next time on
Tokyo Underground...

22:31.991 --> 22:34.294
..."Collapse - Tormented Mind".

22:34.294 --> 22:39.288
Collapse - Tormented Mind
